# AI Agent Guidelines (local-finances-manager)

Public OSS: **local-first** personal finance (Plaid, exports, budgets, optional AI). Keep changes contributor-friendly.

## Source of truth

| Area | Location |
|------|----------|
| App behavior | `src/`, `public/`, `README.md`, `.env.example` |
| Operator runbooks | `docs/operations/` (index: `docs/README.md`) |
| Work tracking | GitHub Issues on `rohitnandwate/local-finances-manager` |

## Safety (never commit)

- `.data/`, `.env`, `.env.local`, `exports/`, `briefings/`, `data/imports/`, user portfolio data
- Secrets, tokens, or personal financial exports

Run `npm run scan:secrets` when touching secrets-adjacent paths. Contributors should run `npm run setup:hooks` once per clone.

## Workflow

1. **Plan** — Read README and relevant `docs/operations/` runbook.
2. **Execute** — Minimal focused diff; match existing style.
3. **Verify** — `npm run typecheck`; related smoke tests or `npm test` when appropriate.

See [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) for tool-agnostic agent instructions.
